---
import ProseLayout from '../layouts/ProseLayout.astro';
import site from '../../data/site.json';
---

<ProseLayout
  title="Terms of use for readers and sponsors"
  description="The terms for reading NewsMapp, suggesting outlets and buying a sponsored listing, including editorial review, refunds and cancellation."
  heading="Terms of use"
  updated="2026-10-27"
>
  <h2>Using the directory</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      NewsMapp links to outlets it does not control. Their content, paywalls and terms are their
      own.
    </li>
    <li>
      We check listings carefully but cannot guarantee that every fact is current. Report errors
      through the <a href="/corrections/">correction form</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      You may link to any page and quote short parts with attribution. Copying the directory in bulk
      is not allowed.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Sponsored listings</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      A sponsored listing is a monthly or yearly subscription for one place in one category of one
      country, paid through LemonSqueezy.
    </li>
    <li>Every purchase is reviewed. If we decline a listing, the payment is refunded in full.</li>
    <li>You can cancel at any time; the listing stays until the end of the period you paid for.</li>
    <li>
      A sponsored listing never changes an outlet's editorial position, and we may remove a listing
      that misleads readers, with a refund for the unused period.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    {site.legal_name}, <a href={`mailto:${site.contact_email}`}>{site.contact_email}</a>. These
    terms are governed by the law of {site.jurisdiction}.
  </p>
</ProseLayout>
